Input: {"question": "Which Wikimedia project has Lien Verburgt-Kramers been listed on the focus list for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 109, "text": "**Breaking News: Dutch Watercolorist Lien Verburgt-Kramers Gains Recognition in Effort to Bridge Gender Gap**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 111, "end": 285, "text": "In a significant step towards promoting gender equality, the Wikimedia project NL Gendergap maintenance has added Dutch watercolorist Lien Verburgt-Kramers to its focus list."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 286, "end": 443, "text": "This initiative aims to increase the representation of women on Wikipedia, addressing the long-standing issue of gender imbalance on the online encyclopedia."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 444, "end": 592, "text": "Lien Verburgt-Kramers, born in 1876 and passed away in 1968, was a talented Dutch watercolorist who made significant contributions to the art world."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 593, "end": 724, "text": "Despite her remarkable achievements, her work and legacy have often been overlooked in the male-dominated art historical narrative."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 725, "end": 800, "text": "\"We are thrilled to have Lien Verburgt-Kramers on our focus list,\" said Dr."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 801, "end": 880, "text": "Saskia Wouters, a historian and member of the NL Gendergap maintenance project."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 881, "end": 1046, "text": "\"Her inclusion is a testament to our commitment to recognizing and celebrating the achievements of women who have been marginalized or forgotten throughout history.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1047, "end": 1151, "text": "According to data from the Wikimedia Foundation, only 18.2% of biographies on Wikipedia are about women."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1152, "end": 1329, "text": "This staggering statistic highlights the need for initiatives like NL Gendergap maintenance, which seeks to bridge the gender gap by creating and improving articles about women."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1330, "end": 1437, "text": "\"Lien Verburgt-Kramers' addition to our focus list is a crucial step in rectifying the imbalance,\" said Dr."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1438, "end": 1446, "text": "Wouters."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1447, "end": 1594, "text": "\"By sharing her story and showcasing her remarkable talent, we hope to inspire a new generation of women to pursue careers in the arts and beyond.\""}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1595, "end": 1765, "text": "The NL Gendergap maintenance project has made significant strides in recent years, with a 25% increase in articles about women on the Dutch Wikipedia since its inception."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1766, "end": 1909, "text": "The project's efforts have also led to the creation of new articles about women in various fields, including science, politics, and literature."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1910, "end": 2078, "text": "\"Lien Verburgt-Kramers' recognition is a testament to the power of collaborative efforts to promote gender equality,\" said Wikimedia Netherlands Chair, Sandra Rientjes."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2079, "end": 2201, "text": "\"We are proud to support initiatives that challenge the status quo and provide a platform for women's voices to be heard.\""}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2202, "end": 2437, "text": "As the NL Gendergap maintenance project continues to grow and expand, it is clear that Lien Verburgt-Kramers' inclusion is just the beginning of a larger movement to recognize and celebrate the achievements of women throughout history."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 112, "text": "**ARTICLE TITLE:** \"Unlikely Hero: Dutch Watercolorist Lien Verburgt-Kramers Makes Waves in Badminton Community\""}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 114, "end": 138, "text": "**DATE:** March 15, 2023"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 140, "end": 379, "text": "In a surprising turn of events, the Wikimedia project WikiProject Badminton\\/tournament focus list has added an unlikely name to its roster: Lien Verburgt-Kramers, a renowned Dutch watercolorist from the late 19th and early 20th centuries."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 380, "end": 558, "text": "The news has left both art and badminton enthusiasts scratching their heads, wondering what connection this celebrated artist could possibly have to the fast-paced racquet sport."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 559, "end": 665, "text": "According to sources close to the project, Verburgt-Kramers' inclusion on the focus list is not a mistake."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 666, "end": 804, "text": "In fact, researchers have uncovered a fascinating, albeit obscure, chapter in the artist's life that reveals a deep passion for badminton."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 805, "end": 975, "text": "\"We were digging through archives and stumbled upon a series of letters exchanged between Verburgt-Kramers and her niece, who was an avid badminton player,\" explained Dr."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 976, "end": 1042, "text": "Sophia Patel, a leading expert on Verburgt-Kramers' life and work."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1043, "end": 1214, "text": "\"It turns out that Lien was not only a talented artist but also a skilled badminton player who even participated in local tournaments in the Netherlands during the 1920s.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1215, "end": 1373, "text": "Patel, who has written extensively on Verburgt-Kramers' art and legacy, believes that the artist's involvement in badminton had a profound impact on her work."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1374, "end": 1486, "text": "\"You can see the influence of badminton in her brushstrokes, the way she captured movement and energy on canvas."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1487, "end": 1537, "text": "It's a fascinating intersection of art and sport.\""}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1538, "end": 1731, "text": "The WikiProject Badminton\\/tournament focus list, which aims to improve the coverage of badminton tournaments on Wikipedia, has taken notice of Verburgt-Kramers' unique connection to the sport."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1732, "end": 1812, "text": "\"We're thrilled to have Lien on our list,\" said project coordinator, Rachel Lee."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1813, "end": 1946, "text": "\"Her story is a testament to the power of passion and creativity, and we're excited to explore this lesser-known aspect of her life.\""}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1947, "end": 2114, "text": "As news of Verburgt-Kramers' badminton connection spreads, art enthusiasts and badminton fans alike are flocking to social media to share their thoughts and reactions."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2115, "end": 2190, "text": "\"Who knew that one of my favorite artists was also a badminton enthusiast?\""}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2191, "end": 2213, "text": "tweeted @ArtLover3000."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Wikimedia project", "scope": "specific", "claim": "Lien Verburgt-Kramers has been listed on the focus list for the NL Gendergap maintenance project.", "answer": "NL Gendergap maintenance", "quote": "In a significant step towards promoting gender equality, the Wikimedia project NL Gendergap maintenance has added Dutch watercolorist Lien Verburgt-Kramers to its focus list.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Lien Verburgt-Kramers", "scope": "Wikimedia project", "claim": "Lien Verburgt-Kramers has been listed on the focus list for WikiProject Badminton/tournament.", "answer": "WikiProject Badminton/tournament", "quote": "In a surprising turn of events, the Wikimedia project WikiProject Badminton\\/tournament focus list has added an unlikely name to its roster: Lien Verburgt-Kramers, a renowned Dutch watercolorist from the late 19th and early 20th centuries.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["NL Gendergap maintenance", "WikiProject Badminton/tournament"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "NL Gendergap maintenance", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "WikiProject Badminton/tournament", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
